      "id": "sol.amc-8-1994-p13.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The number halfway between two values is their average: \\(\\dfrac{\\frac16 + \\frac14}{2}.\\)\n\nSince \\(\\dfrac16 + \\dfrac14 = \\dfrac{2}{12} + \\dfrac{3}{12} = \\dfrac{5}{12},\\) the average is \\(\\dfrac{5}{12} \\div 2 = \\dfrac{5}{24}.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is C .",
